  "body": "Welcome to a spacious and inviting 236sqm home, thoughtfully designed for relaxed family living and effortless entertaining. It offers five generous bedrooms, each with its own bathroom, plus a versatile sixth room ideal as a home office or study. This two level re-built home received its Code Compliance Certificate (CCC) in 2021.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the warm and welcoming living area flows naturally into the kitchen and dining space, then outdoors to a lovely garden and covered patio with a beautiful timber ceiling. It's the perfect spot to gather with family and friends or simply unwind in your own private outdoor retreat.\r\n\r\nEveryday comfort is made easy with:\r\n\r\n* Central air conditioning\r\n\r\n* A whole-home surround-sound system\r\n\r\n* Underfloor heating in the bathrooms\r\n\r\n* A beautiful landscape garden with auto irrigation system\r\n\r\n* A secure electric gate with intercom\r\n\r\nJust a 2-3 minute stroll from Mission Bay Beach, cafes and restaurants, you'll have the best of coastal living right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nA home of this size and quality is a rare find in the Bays. The vendors have already moved into their next home and are ready to see this one sold before Christmas creating a wonderful opportunity for its next owners.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the warmth, space and lifestyle for yourself. We'd love to welcome you to one of our open homes.",
